<%--
Card_Widget - standalone card container (chrome + padded body, no header anatomy)

default content - the card body; stacked children get the standard block rhythm

The plain page-level card. For a titled section with header anatomy use
<Section> instead.

Usage:
    <Card_Widget>
        <Entity_Header> ... </Entity_Header>
        <Tab_Bar ... />
        <Tab_Panels> ... </Tab_Panels>
    </Card_Widget>
--%>
<Define:Card_Widget extends="View_Section_Abstract" class="View_Section_Abstract card shadow-sm">
    <div class="View_Section_Abstract__stack card-body">
        <%= content() %>
    </div>
</Define:Card_Widget>
